  m_text: 'Welcome aboard!


    I hope you have gotten a chance to get a tour around
    the ship, you will primarily be dealing with reports and direct incidents with
    crew, then any final and important decisions will be decided by me or the corp.
    Our card station is down and will most likely be repaired mid dive, so be sure
    to go grab yours when its operational!


    Stay Safe'
